  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味が　強い　食材。スライスされていて　サンドウィッチの具材として　扱いやすいのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛이 강한 식재료. 슬라이스해서 샌드위치 재료로 넣기 좋다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味強勁的食材。切成的薄片在製作三明治時很好使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très sucré. Coupé en tranches fines, ce fruit est plus facile à ajouter à un Sandwich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In Scheiben geschnitten lässt sich mit dieser sehr süßen Zutat problemlos ein Sandwich belegen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cortada en rebanadas, esta fruta de sabor muy dulce es muy fácil de incluir en cualquier preparación.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto dolce. Tagliato a fettine, può essere agevolmente usato per imbottire i panini.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This very sweet ingredient is sliced thin to make it easy to add into a sandwich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甘味が　強い　食材。スライスされていて　サンドウィッチの具材として　扱いやすいのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味强烈的食材。切成了片，作为三明治馅料用起来十分方便。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
